  "details": "I apologize for the informal nature of this, but I am tired but I wanted to get this idea out.\n\nWhat if VRChat implemented UGC for items, except sharing was only if you were explicitly in the same instance as someone else and they accepted it?\n\nThis way, their paid content model isn't sabotaged by free items, but people can still share UGC.\n\nAlso promotes socializing. :)\n\nI was mainly thinking how cool it could be that I they could even have a permissions system, where you can share it with the friend, but that friend can't share it with other people.\n\nI.E: You could make unique items for your friends, literally gifts. <3",
